# ==============================================================================
# SI MANDAU KEMENAG BARITO UTARA - Centralized Monorepo Git Ignore
# Covers: Root, Frontend (Astro 5 / React 19 / Vite), Backend (Go / Air / Fiber)
# ==============================================================================

# ── 1. Monorepo & Package Manager Dependencies ──
node_modules/
*/node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

