.astro/
*/.astro/
**/.astro/
dist/
*/dist/
**/dist/
build/
*/build/
**/build/
out/
*/out/
**/out/
.next/
*/.next/
**/.next/
.cache/
*/.cache/
**/.cache/
.turbo/
*/.turbo/
**/.turbo/

# ── 3. Golang Backend Artifacts & Air Hot-Reload ──
